hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"355","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ibn al-'As reported that it reached him that\nthe Prophet"
"356","The same from 'Amr ibn Shu'ayb."""""
"357","The same from Abu Umama."""""
"358","Al-Ash'ari said"
"359","Same as 354."""""
"360","Rafi' ibn Khudayj and Sahl ibn Abi Hathama reported that 'Abdullah\nibn Sahl and Muhayyisa ibn Mas'ud came to Khaybar and parted when they\nwere among the palm trees. 'Abdullah ibn Sahl was murdered. 'Abdu'r-Rahman\nibn Sahl and Huwayyisa and Muhayyisa"
"361","Ibn 'Umar said"
"362","""Fear Allah and make the oldest among you your leaders.\nWhen people make the oldest among them their leaders"
"363","Abu Hurayra said"
